.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RULE TOGGLE"
.SH NAME
hamstik rule toggle \- Enable or disable a rule through the server\-owned transition
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik rule toggle [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enable or disable a rule through the server\-owned transition
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I RULE_ID
Automation rule id
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --body-file
Read the JSON request body from this file; `-` reads stdin
.TP
.B --field
Structured JSON field as `key=value`; repeatable
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Idempotency key override
